# Ragged Playmate: "{1}, {T}: Target creature with power 2 or less can't be blocked this turn." In turn 3 the targets are checked: Bot2's
# 3/3 Hill Giant (power 3, one over the limit) is refused while Bot1's 2/2 Runeclaw Bear (exactly 2) is accepted. The {1} and the tap are
# the whole cost (Mox Jet pays, the Playmate is tapped). Bot2's Ornithopter may not block the Bear in turn 3 (Bot2 takes 2) but may in
# turn 5 ("this turn" has ended) and dies to the Bear.

